      `the notice was given because the person who received it asserted claims from the employment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because the person who received it asserted claims from the employment? (If you gave the notice, that person is your employee; if your employee gave the notice, it is you.)
      `the person who received the notice asserted those claims in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person who received the notice assert those claims in good faith (nach Treu und Glauben)?
      `the notice was given because the person who received it performs Swiss compulsory military service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because the person who received it performs Swiss compulsory military service? (If you gave the notice, that person is your employee; if your employee gave the notice, it is you.)
      `the notice was given because the person who received it performs Swiss compulsory civil protection service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because the person who received it performs Swiss compulsory civil protection service (Schutzdienst)?
      `the notice was given because the person who received it performs Swiss civilian service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because the person who received it performs Swiss civilian service (Zivildienst)?
      `the notice was given because the person who received it is fulfilling a legal duty` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because the person who received it is fulfilling a legal duty (gesetzliche Pflicht)?
      `the person who received the notice took on that legal duty voluntarily` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person who received the notice take on that legal duty voluntarily (freiwillig übernommen)?
      `the notice was given because the employee belongs to an employees' association` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because your employee belongs to an employees' association (Arbeitnehmerverband)? Only a notice given by the employer is read under this question.
      `the notice was given because the employee does not belong to an employees' association` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because your employee does not belong to an employees' association?
      `the notice was given because the employee lawfully takes part in union activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given because your employee lawfully takes part in union activity (gewerkschaftliche Tätigkeit)?
      `the notice was given while the employee was an elected employee representative in a body of the business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given while your employee was an elected employee representative in a body of the business (betriebliche Einrichtung)? Only a notice given by the employer is read under this question.
      `the notice was given while the employee was an elected employee representative in a body connected with the undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given while your employee was an elected employee representative in an institution connected with the undertaking (dem Unternehmen angeschlossene Einrichtung)?
      `the employer can prove it had a justified reason for the notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can you prove that you had a justified reason (begründeter Anlass) for the notice?
      `the employee's mandate as representative ended because the employment was transferred` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did your employee's mandate as employee representative end because the employment was transferred to a new employer (Art. 333)? Only a notice given by the employer is read under this question.
      `the day the notice was given` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice given? (Any date if the employment was not transferred.)
      `the last day the employee's mandate would have lasted if the employment had not been transferred` IS A DATE @desc On what day would your employee's mandate as employee representative have ended if the employment had not been transferred? (Any date if the employment was not transferred.)
      `the notice was given as part of a mass dismissal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given as part of a mass dismissal (Massenentlassung)? Only a notice given by the employer is read under this question.
      `the employees have an employee representation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the employees have an employee representation (Arbeitnehmervertretung)?
      `the employee representation was consulted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the employee representation consulted before the notices were given?
      `the employees were consulted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the employees themselves consulted before the notices were given? (This matters only where there is no employee representation.)
