GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `As the employer, what is the most compensation I can be made to pay for the notice I gave (Art 336a(2) and (3))` IS
    `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be`
        `abusive on a listed ground`
        (`Art 336(2)(c) the notice is abusive` `the party giving notice` `my facts for Art 336(2)(c)`)
