            `the other party asserts those claims in good faith` IS `the person who received the notice asserted those claims in good faith`
        `my facts for Art 336(1)(e)` MEANS `Art 336(1)(e) facts` WITH
            `the notice was given because the other party performs Swiss compulsory military service` IS `the notice was given because the person who received it performs Swiss compulsory military service`
            `the notice was given because the other party performs Swiss compulsory civil protection service` IS `the notice was given because the person who received it performs Swiss compulsory civil protection service`
            `the notice was given because the other party performs Swiss civilian service` IS `the notice was given because the person who received it performs Swiss civilian service`
            `the notice was given because the other party fulfils a legal duty` IS `the notice was given because the person who received it is fulfilling a legal duty`
            `the other party assumed that legal duty voluntarily` IS `the person who received the notice took on that legal duty voluntarily`
        `my facts for Art 336(2)(a)` MEANS `Art 336(2)(a) facts` WITH
            `the notice was given because the employee belongs to an employees' association` IS `the notice was given because the employee belongs to an employees' association`
            `the notice was given because the employee does not belong to an employees' association` IS `the notice was given because the employee does not belong to an employees' association`
            `the notice was given because the employee lawfully exercises a union activity` IS `the notice was given because the employee lawfully takes part in union activity`
        `my facts for Art 336(2)(b)` MEANS `Art 336(2)(b) facts` WITH
            `the notice was given while the employee was an elected employee representative in a body of the business` IS `the notice was given while the employee was an elected employee representative in a body of the business`
            `the notice was given while the employee was an elected employee representative in a body connected with the undertaking` IS `the notice was given while the employee was an elected employee representative in a body connected with the undertaking`
            `the employer can prove a justified reason for the notice` IS `the employer can prove it had a justified reason for the notice`
        `my facts for Art 336(2)(c)` MEANS `Art 336(2)(c) facts` WITH
            `the notice was given as part of a mass dismissal` IS `the notice was given as part of a mass dismissal`
            `there is an employee representation` IS `the employees have an employee representation`
            `the employee representation was consulted` IS `the employee representation was consulted`
            `the employees were consulted` IS `the employees were consulted`
        `my facts for Art 336(3)` MEANS `Art 336(3) facts` WITH
