            `the last day the mandate would have lasted had the employment not been transferred` IS `the last day the employee's mandate would have lasted if the employment had not been transferred`
        `my notice` MEANS `Notice of termination` WITH
            `given by` IS Employer
            `facts for Art 336(1)(a)` IS `my facts for Art 336(1)(a)`
            `facts for Art 336(1)(b)` IS `my facts for Art 336(1)(b)`
            `facts for Art 336(1)(c)` IS `my facts for Art 336(1)(c)`
