            `facts for Art 336(3)` IS `my facts for Art 336(3)`
        `abusive on a listed ground` MEANS
            `Art 336 a ground the Article lists makes the notice abusive` `my notice`

-- Art 336a(2). The compensation may not exceed the cap; an amount above it is not allowed. Asked for a notice you gave.
@export As the employer, is this amount of compensation within the cap (Art 336a(2))?
